<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span><span id="S5.T1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Zero-shot long-horizon evaluation on the Calvin ABC<math id="S5.T1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math>D benchmark</span> where agent is asked to complete five chained tasks sequentially based on instructions. TriVLA demonstrates a significant improvement in the average task completion length (Avg. Len).</figcaption>
</figure>
